        "id": 3758334
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-07-09T10:39:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sry but would you mind to provide a example?\n\nCurrently I relies on bind groupt tracker to help me set correct root signature before draw or dispatch. And we have OnSetPipeline to ensure dirty for next pipeline. And I think we setup internal constants always.\n\nSo I\u0027m a bit confuse about this. An simple example is appreciate, thanks!",
      "parentUuid": "36c89c7c_2cd68595",
      "revId": "2539e7d08f19eef0ab09ad23ade569b27b849e58",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
