      "writtenOn": "2025-07-09T12:08:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure that an example will help. It\u0027s more important to understand how D3D12 is specified as understanding the exact semantic leads to better solutions.\n\nWhat I mean is that when the call at [2] happens, all the contents of the root signature, constants, descriptors and descriptor tables is invalidated. Which is why we pass `false` at [3] for `CanInheritBindGroups`. We should have something similar for root constants as they get invalidated the same way.",
      "parentUuid": "e8421ea3_4a38b5d4",
